id=oplus_ddrc_control
name=OPlus DDRC Control
version=v0.1.0-alpha
versionCode=1
author=BakaronLab
description=Runtime override of the OPlus DDRC low-battery voltage policy (GAUGE_TERM_VOLTAGE / GAUGE_SHUTDOWN_VOLTAGE) through the kernel votable debug-force interface. Default BALANCED; FULL_OEM is experimental and opt-in. Writes no partitions, no boot images and no persistent gauge data. Tested only on PKU110 (silicon_1).
